---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /whats-changed.html
navKey: whats-changed
pageTitle: What's Changed
kicker: "Site Updates"
heading: "What's Changed"
sectionLinks:
  - id: content-changes
    label: Content changes
  - id: technical-changes
    label: Technical changes
---

{% macro changeItem(update) %}
  <li class="change-item">
    <time datetime="{{ update.date }}">{{ update.displayDate or update.date }}</time>
    <h3>{{ update.title }}</h3>
    <p>{{ update.summary }}</p>

    {% if update.pages and update.pages.length %}
    <div class="change-meta">
      <strong>Pages updated:</strong>
      {% for page in update.pages %}
        <a href="{{ page.url | url }}">{{ page.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if update.sourceIds and update.sourceIds.length %}
    <div class="change-meta">
      <strong>Related sources:</strong>
      {% for sourceId in update.sourceIds %}
        <a href="{{ ('/references.html#ref-' + sourceId) | url }}">[{{ sourceId | refIndex }}]</a>{% if not loop.last %} {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </li>
{% endmacro %}

{% set sortedUpdates = updates | sortByDateDesc %}
{% set updateGroups = sortedUpdates | groupBy("category") %}

  <p>This page tracks substantive content, source, and technical updates to the SR-177 Weber County analysis. Content changes are listed first because they are more important for readers deciding whether guidance, facts, or source context has changed.</p>

  <div class="callout info">
    <p><strong>Update standard:</strong> Any AI-assisted research pass should add a new entry here when it changes site content, source attribution, guidance, timelines, or page structure. If an update includes both content and technical changes, classify it as a content change. Small typo-only fixes do not need an entry.</p>
  </div>

<section class="change-section" aria-labelledby="content-changes-heading">
  <div class="section-label jump-target" id="content-changes">Content Changes</div>
  <h2 id="content-changes-heading">Content Changes</h2>
  <p class="change-section-intro">Research, source, disclosure, timeline, and guidance updates that can affect how readers understand or use the site.</p>

  <ol class="change-list">
    {% for update in updateGroups.content %}
      {{ changeItem(update) }}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="change-section" aria-labelledby="technical-changes-heading">
  <div class="section-label jump-target" id="technical-changes">Technical Changes</div>
  <h2 id="technical-changes-heading">Technical Changes</h2>
  <p class="change-section-intro">Navigation, layout, publishing, accessibility, and infrastructure updates that change how the site works rather than the project analysis itself.</p>

  <ol class="change-list">
    {% for update in updateGroups.technical %}
      {{ changeItem(update) }}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
